Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the core, AI is a new technology that is reshaping every industry.\N本质上，人工智能是一项正在重塑所有行业的新兴技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:18.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because this is a general purpose technology and because of its transformative capabilities for every single industry,\N因为这是一项通用技术，且其对每个行业都具有变革性能力，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,for every single citizen, for every company, for every country, uh this is a technology driven industrial revolution.\N对每一位公民、每一家公司、每一个国家而言，这都是一场由技术驱动的工业革命。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This industrial revolution is going to affect uh every single every single person, every country.\N这场工业革命将影响每一个人、每一个国家。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh however, it is also going to be a new industry in itself, not just a technology.\N然而，它本身也将成为一个全新的产业，而不仅仅是一项技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:48.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a new industry in itself because AI is manufacturing.\N它本身就是一个全新的产业，因为人工智能正在实现制造。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:51.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has to be generated in real time.\N它必须实时生成。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:55.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It cannot be pre-computed.\N无法预先计算。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:01:03.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And because it's generated in real time for every single use, it needs to have a new type of factory.\N而且因为它需要为每一次使用实时生成，所以必须具备一种新型工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:03.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:09.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia creates the computing systems that power AI factories.\N英伟达打造了驱动AI工厂的计算系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:14.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's these AI factories requires natural resources.\N而这些AI工厂需要自然资源。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:18.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the natural resources it needs is electricity.\N它所需的自然资源是电力。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It needs electricity.\N它需要电力。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It needs data.\N它需要数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it needs offtake.\N而且需要消纳方。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The offtake is coming from the inspiration of the leadership in Kazakhstan.\N消纳方来自哈萨克斯坦领导层的启发。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're inspiring all of your young people, students, university scientists of the industries.\N你正在激励着所有年轻一代、学生以及产业界的科学家们。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:48.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're inspiring them to engage the AI industry, to engage the AI economy.\N你们正激励他们投身人工智能产业，参与人工智能经济。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:51.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's where the offtake's going to come from.\N那就是消纳方的来源。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kazakhstan has a fundamental advantage because you have so much natural resource already.\N哈萨克斯坦拥有根本性优势，因为你们已经拥有如此丰富的自然资源。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have so much energy.\N你们拥有如此丰富的能源。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And instead of just exporting energy, in the future, you could transform the energy into intelligence and export intelligence.\N未来，你不仅可以输出能源，还能将其转化为智能，出口智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, in order to do all that, you also need to transform your own data.\N然而，要实现这一切，你也需要对自己的数据进行转换。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:26.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And one of the important observations and I'm very happy to see that there is Kazakh LLM.\N而且一个重要的观察是，我很高兴看到有哈萨克语大模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,That you are already transforming, harnessing, processing your own data into your own intelligence.\N你已经在将自身数据转化为自身智能，实现变革、驾驭与处理。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:44.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's important to realize that your country's data embodies, encodes your country's culture,\N重要的是要认识到，一个国家的数据承载并编码了该国的文化。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,history, your humanity, your values are captured in the data.\N历史、人性与价值观，都已融入数据之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that data belongs to you.\N这些数据属于你。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:57.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as your natural resources belong to you.\N正如你的自然资源属于你一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The data of your society is also part of your natural resource.\N你社会的数据也是你自然资源的一部分。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:08.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, you're able to combine the natural resources of energy,\N现在，您可以整合能源的天然资源，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:20.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,the natural resource of the Kazakhstan data of your people in combination with a computation system from Nvidia,\N哈萨克斯坦人民的数据资源，与英伟达的计算系统相结合，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:30.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should be able to produce the intelligence necessary to drive all of the AI economy here in Kazakhstan, which is your vision.\N你应该能够在这里哈萨克斯坦催生出驱动整个AI经济所需的智能，这正是你的愿景。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:37.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your vision is to create the next economy, the digital economy, the AI economy for Kazakhstan.\N你的愿景是为哈萨克斯坦打造下一个经济形态——数字经济和人工智能经济。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the five-layer cake is an excellent framework, and you have all of the assets, all of the natural resources to do so.\N因此，五层蛋糕是一个极佳的框架，而你们拥有实现这一切所需的所有资产和自然资源。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:47.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen, you mentioned about Kazakh LLM, yeah?\N黄仁勋，你提到过哈萨克的大型语言模型，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's speak about a bit uh sovereignty AI, sovereign AI.\N我们来谈一下主权AI，主权AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:57.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh people are questioning whether we need to have our own Kazakh GPT.\N所以，人们开始质疑我们是否真的需要自己的哈萨克GPT。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:04:08.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we want that AI understands and speaks uh Kazakh and uh cultural contexts uh and um cultural specifics.\N所以我们希望AI能理解并使用哈萨克语，以及相关的文化背景和文化细节。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:18.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we built several models, uh Kazakh large language models based on open-source open-weight foundation models.\N因此，我们基于开源的基座模型，构建了多个哈萨克语大语言模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:28.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, at what point it makes sense or it's worthwhile to build the uh our own foundation model from the scratch,\N那么，什么时候从零开始构建我们自己的基础模型是合理且值得的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:30.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,or does it really make sense at all?\N还是说这根本就毫无意义？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:38.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intelligence affects every single citizen, every single company, every single country.\N智能影响着每一位公民、每一家公司、每一个国家。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:43.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,A country's intelligence is produced from its data.\N一个国家的智能源于其数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as we mentioned earlier, your country's data is your natural resource.\N正如我们之前提到的，贵国的数据是你们的天然资源。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It belongs to you.\N它属于你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.76,0:04:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You cannot export something as fundamental as your people's culture and\N你无法将人民的文化这类根本性的东西出口。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,values and export that to import the intelligence from someone else.\N价值并导出，以导入他人的智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense.\N这毫无意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:09.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is So, you want to control your own data.\N是的，你想掌控自己的数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want to control your natural resource.\N你想掌控你的自然资源。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You also want to control the delivery of the service to your people.\N你还需要控制服务交付给员工的流程。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:27.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as you have Kazakhtelecom, you have your own electric grid.\N就像你们有哈萨克电信，你们也有自己的电网。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the future, you will have your own electric grid, your own internet, your own telecommunications, and your own intelligence grid.\N未来，你将拥有自己的电网、自己的互联网、自己的通信网络，以及自己的智能电网。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:51.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense for the intelligence grid, which comes from which powers every part of your country, to be delivered from another country.\N让为国家每个部分提供动力的智能电网，却从另一个国家获取，这毫无意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is okay to have another country and company supplement, but it cannot be completely.\N允许其他国家和公司进行补充，但不能完全依赖。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:09.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, you have to have some ability to deliver the basic infrastructure services for your own country.\N因此，你必须具备为本国提供基本基础设施服务的能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The creation of the Kazakh LLM is\N哈萨克大模型的创建
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,sensible because the invention of the technology is difficult.\N因为这项技术的发明很困难，所以这样做是合理的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the application, the adaptation of the technology is not so difficult.\N但应用这项技术，对其加以适应，并不那么困难。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:30.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's, of course, not easy.\N当然，这并不容易。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, Kazakhstan has a wealth of science and technology and mathematicians and you have so many programmers.\N但哈萨克斯坦拥有丰富的科技资源、众多数学家和大量程序员。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The developers here are rich.\N这里的开发者都很富有。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're rich with expertise here.\N你们的专业能力非常深厚。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:51.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you should be able to take open-source technology, open mono technology, apply it to your language,\N所以，你应该能够将开源技术、开源单体技术应用到你的语言上。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,apply it to your culture, so that you can run and operate the infrastructure of intelligence yourself here.\N将其应用到你们的文化中，以便你们能够自主运行和管理这里的智能基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we also believe that open-source allows us to be sovereign and use it on premise with the sensitive data.\N是的，我们还相信，开源能让我们实现自主可控，并在本地部署，处理敏感数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.85,0:07:12.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have our own, we built our own tokenizer, collected tokens.\N我们自己开发了分词器，收集了词元。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We know how to train, to fine-tune.\N我们知道如何训练，如何微调。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this talent development and human capital development is quite important.\N因此，人才发展和人力资本发展非常重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I saw so many today already.\N今天我已经看到了很多。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:21.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.\N是的，没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you've seen, by the way, you've So many startups are here.\N顺便说一句，你看到了吗，这里有很多初创公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:28.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you've seen some of them are in the physical AI space.\N而且你们已经看到其中一些已经进入物理 AI 领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:32.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's talk a little bit about this physical AI, as you call it.\N那么，我们来聊聊你所说的这个物理 AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:35.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's It's a next wave.\N这是下一波浪潮。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:44.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,People get used to feel AI through the screens, on the screens, on their laptops, computers, smartphones.\N人们习惯通过屏幕感受AI，无论是电脑、笔记本、智能手机上的屏幕。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:47.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now, with the next wave,\N但现在，随着新一轮浪潮的到来，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's moving into the physical AI and where the robots and other hardware systems will interact with each other and work together.\N它正迈向物理 AI，机器人及其他硬件系统将相互交互并协同工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:08:01.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Kazakhstan is a rich on heavy industries.\N因此，哈萨克斯坦在重工业方面资源丰富。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we have factories, mines, transport agriculture agriculture, transport and logistics infrastructure,\N所以我们拥有工厂、矿场、农业、交通运输以及物流基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and of course, the talented people with the deep expertise in those industries.\N当然，还有那些在相关行业拥有深厚专业技能的杰出人才。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:25.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, how what should Kazakhstan do in order to become a hub or a hub for training the robots.\N那么，哈萨克斯坦应如何做，才能成为机器人训练的枢纽？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:28.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've seen some initial work already.\N你已经看到一些初步成果了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:34.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, our specialists know how to train the robots, how to train the models, and work with them.\N因此，我们的专家知道如何训练机器人和模型，并与它们协作。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:43.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think the Kazakhstan to become a hub and maybe the one of the main partners for Nvidia to train the models for a physical AI?\N那么，你觉得哈萨克斯坦能否成为中心，甚至成为英伟达训练物理AI模型的主要合作伙伴之一？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:48.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a fantastic idea, and I think it's also an imperative for you to do so.\N这是个绝佳的主意，我认为对你来说，这也是一个必然的选择。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:51.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want Kazakhstan to be an AI nation.\N你希望哈萨克斯坦成为一个人工智能国家。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI starts with cognitive AI, cognitive intelligence, soft intelligence,\NAI 从认知 AI、认知智能、软智能开始，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:05.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,but AI includes everything all the way to physical AI.\N但人工智能涵盖了从头到尾的一切，一直到物理人工智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:14.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Physical AI is the largest industry of all, of course, because most of the world includes interaction and understanding of the physical world.\N物理 AI 是最大的产业，当然，因为世界上大部分领域都涉及对物理世界的交互与理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:18.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You also have very important application here yourself.\N你自身在这里也有非常重要的应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mining and natural resources and agriculture, all of the your own indigenous industries today will benefit from the next phase with physical AI.\N采矿、自然资源和农业等本土产业，都将从物理 AI 的下一阶段中受益。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:33.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, physical AI is not just robotics.\N如今，物理 AI 不仅限于机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:36.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Robotics is going to be very important.\N机器人技术将变得非常重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The physical AI includes everything from seismic understanding to mapping mines\N物理 AI 涵盖从地震理解到探查矿藏的方方面面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:51.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and wells to understanding geography 100 and geology where to mine,\N以及了解地理和地质，确定矿产开采位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.25,0:09:59.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,how best to mine, uh understanding material science, the processing of chemicals.\N如何最好地挖掘材料科学和化学加工的理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:02.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of that is going to be part of physical AI,\N所有这些都将属于物理 AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:08.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,and AI will be able to tremendously transform each one of those fields from the\N而人工智能将能够极大地改变这些领域中的每一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:15.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,mining of the processing of the minerals to the transformation of the minerals into new materials.\N从矿产的开采，到矿产加工为新材料的全过程。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,In every single stage of that will benefit from physical AI.\N在每一个阶段都将受益于物理 AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, we're at the beginning of the physical AI journey.\N现在，我们正处于物理 AI 旅程的起点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:28.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the next wave.\N这是下一波浪潮。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, everybody is in the beginning.\N因此，每个人都在起点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:36.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a great opportunity for you to participate to help shape this future industry.\N这是你参与其中、共同塑造这一未来产业的绝佳机会。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the future, just as we will have artificial general intelligence for cognitive cognitive intelligence,\N未来，我们将拥有用于认知智能的人工通用智能，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,cognitive AI, we will have artificial general robotics.\N认知型AI，我们将拥有通用机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I saw some today.\N今天我看到了一些。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:58.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cozmo was an example of at the beginnings of artificial general robotics.\N科兹莫是通用机器人早期的一个例子。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:03.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I have great great hopes and ambition that this will be a very large industry.\N我怀着极大的希望和雄心，相信这将发展成一个非常庞大的产业。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:06.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're delighted to partner with the robotics company here.\N我们很高兴能与这家机器人公司合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:10.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was so happy to see NVIDIA is already working with all of them.\N我很高兴看到英伟达已经和他们所有人展开了合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:11.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so it's great to see.\N看到这一点真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we'll try to produce artificial general engineers.\N我们将努力培养人工通用工程师。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:16.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.\N没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.79,0:11:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Artificial general farmers, artificial general miners, artificial general scientists, every single field.\N通用人工智能农民、通用人工智能矿工、通用人工智能科学家，所有领域皆可。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Great.\N好极了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:34.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the main question that concerns people they've been sitting around\N人们最关心的问题之一，就是他们一直在思考的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:39.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,us is uh their jobs and how AI will convert their working lives.\N我们关心的是他们的工作，以及人工智能将如何改变他们的工作方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.01,0:11:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So everyone is curious about whether AI will help make their jobs better or will lead for them to left behind.\N所以每个人都好奇，AI 是会让自己工作变得更好，还是会让自己落后。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:55.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what do you think uh what should people care about and\N那你觉得人们应该关心什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:12:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh use their energy for developing them in five maybe next five years.\N嗯，把他们的精力用在五年内或接下来五年内开发它们上。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters\N唯一重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,is do you have ambition?\N你有雄心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:25.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have ambition, then AI and robotics will lift you.\N如果你有雄心，那么人工智能和机器人技术将助你腾飞。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:29.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will empower you to do more.\N它将赋予你更多能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you were a farmer and you have ambition, the robots will help you farm.\N如果你是一位有抱负的农民，机器人将帮你耕种。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.81,0:12:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,But because you have ambition, you can expand your operation.\N但正因为有雄心，你才能扩大你的业务。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.81,0:12:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can expand your horizon.\N你可以拓展你的视野。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:47.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can expand your business.\N你可以拓展你的业务。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you are a scientist and you have ambition, then your AI assistant will expand the universe that you can explore.\N如果你是一位有抱负的科学家，你的AI助手将拓展你所能探索的宇宙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you are an engineer and you have ambition, then your AI engineer will allow you to explore better designs.\N如果你是一名工程师并且有抱负，那么你的AI工程师将帮助你探索更优的设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.05,0:13:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the question is simply, do you have ambition?\N所以，问题很简单，你有雄心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:15.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have ambition and I believe you do,\N如果你有雄心，我相信你确实有。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI will lift your people.\NAI 将托举你们的人民。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.22,0:13:23.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI will expand your company so that you can compete and expand globally.\NAI将拓展您的公司，让您具备全球竞争与扩张的能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.81,0:13:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI will transform your society.\NAI 将改变你的社会。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.65,0:13:30.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's how I would think about AI.\N这就是我思考人工智能的方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:40.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ambition and the uh talent and creativity should be uh taking through the since the childhood.\N雄心以及天赋和创造力应从童年时期就开始培养。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you've seen all these kids today, the TUMO program that spans from 12 to 18 years old.\N所以，你们今天看到了这些孩子，TUMO 项目覆盖了12到18岁的青少年。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:52.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've seen the Tomorrow School in partnership with École 42, the peer-to-peer education, which is the 18 plus.\N你已经看到与École 42合作的明日学校，这是一种同龄人之间的教育模式，面向18岁以上人群。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we embed Those are all people with ambition.\N我们所关注的，都是心怀雄心的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.13,0:13:56.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.\N是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Children with ambition.\N有抱负的孩子们。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.89,0:13:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.41,0:13:59.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we uh embed AI into education, into schools, universities.\N因此，我们将人工智能融入教育，融入学校和大学。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:10.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the concern that uh people expressing right now,\N目前人们普遍担忧的问题是，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:17.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,how do we make sure that AI helps children to become better thinkers rather than\N我们如何确保人工智能帮助孩子成为更优秀的思考者，而非相反？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:24.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,just relying purely on the eye and uh um to make it harmful for them.\N仅仅依靠眼睛和呃，来让他们感到有害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.65,0:14:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, the question is whether that child has ambition and aspiration.\N同样，问题在于那个孩子是否有雄心和抱负。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the child wants to learn more, AI will help them learn more.\N如果孩子想学得更多，AI 就会帮助他们学得更多。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:42.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the If the child wants to do less, then the AI, of course, can help them do less.\N如果孩子想少做一点，AI 当然可以帮他们少做一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:49.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, it is our job as parents to imbue our children,\N因此，作为父母，我们的责任是赋予孩子这些品质，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:57.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,instill our children with hope, ambition, aspiration to help them dream bigger.\N让我们的孩子心怀希望、抱负与志向，助他们梦想远大。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:15:04.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when you dream big, then AI will lift you to achieve that.\N当你梦想远大时，AI 就会助你实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Same exact idea for children as well as for adults, for companies as well as countries and nations.\N同样的理念，既适用于儿童，也适用于成人；既适用于企业，也适用于国家与民族。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.21,0:15:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have aspiration, if you have ambition,\N如果你有抱负，如果你有雄心，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.53,0:15:19.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this as all the companies that I've met so far?\N这是我目前为止见过的所有公司吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.45,0:15:21.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have ambition to be great.\N你有成为伟大的雄心。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:23.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have ambition to be global.\N你有成为全球企业的雄心。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.29,0:15:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have ambition to be international.\N你有成为国际企业的雄心。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,That ambition will be powered by AI.\N这一雄心将由人工智能驱动。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:36.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the most important thing we need to do as country leaders like yourself, as CEOs like myself and my friends,\N因此，作为像你们这样的国家领导人，像我及我的朋友们这样的企业首席执行官，我们需要做的最重要的一件事是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.95,0:15:46.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,as parents, is to instill upon our people, our families, our companies, our nation, instill upon them ambition.\N作为父母，就是要在我们的人民、家庭、企业乃至整个国家心中，种下雄心。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me give you a real example of ambition then.\N那我来举一个雄心的真实例子。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we have um we talk about this youth, ambition, and the real case of ambition.\N所以，我们谈到了年轻人的抱负，以及抱负的真实案例。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.93,0:16:02.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let me turn to our AI unicorn, Higgsfield.\N那么，让我转向我们的AI独角兽——Higgsfield。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh I think this is the greatest example of ambition of young people.\N所以啊，我认为这正是年轻人雄心壮志的最佳体现。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:14.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's uh our first AI unicorn.\N这是我们首个AI独角兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The average age of the team is 25.\N团队的平均年龄是25岁。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:22.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And by the way, we have a main co-founders here with us today.\N顺便说一下，今天我们现场还有联合创始人之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:29.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh we have uh Alex Mashrabov and uh Yersultan Bolat along with their broader team here.\N还有亚历克斯·马什拉博夫和耶尔苏坦·博拉特，以及他们更广泛的团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, please stand.\N请起立。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:32.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.\N是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:35.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:41.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,The company is valued at a multi-billion uh valuation right now.\N该公司目前估值高达数十亿美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:48.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh I have a good update, good news for the people around us and those watching online.\N呃，我有个好消息要分享，对身边的人以及在线观看的朋友们都很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA has invested into Higgsfield.\N英伟达已投资 Higgsfield。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:17:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just a few words about Higgsfield.\N简单说几句关于 Higgsfield 的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, what really made NVIDIA decide to invest into Higgsfield?\N那么，究竟是什么让英伟达下定决心投资 Higgsfield？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:10.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,\N所以，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.47,0:17:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,just uh for the other followers to be what should be a northern star\N只是为了让其他关注者明白，什么才应该是北极星
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,for them in order to be in compliant compliant to the investment decisions as yourselves?\N为了让他们符合你们自身的投资决策要求吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, the first thing is this.\N嗯，首先这一点是……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first thing and the last thing is you invest in people, not companies.\N最重要的事和最后一件事都是投资于人，而不是公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the founders of Higgsfield are visionary in the work that they do.\N希格斯菲尔德的创始人在他们的工作中极具远见。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,They had a wonderful idea.\N他们有个绝妙的主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.13,0:17:42.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to do.\N这并不容易做到。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.09,0:17:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It did require and they have global competitors.\N这确实需要，而且他们面临全球竞争对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:47.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have global competitors.\N他们面临着全球竞争对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many of them are in San Francisco, United States.\N其中许多位于美国旧金山。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.45,0:17:54.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredibly well funded.\N资金极其雄厚。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And a formidable expertise.\N以及强大的专业能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:59.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, these are some of the brightest people in the world.\N但这些人是世界上最聪明的一批人之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:03.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have an 600 people here in Kazakhstan.\N他们在这里有600人。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.23,0:18:07.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you have a average age of 25 years old.\N你们的平均年龄是25岁。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:17.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many of them are deep tech engineers and deep tech computer scientists already with offices here in Kazakhstan and in United States,\N他们中的许多人都已是深耕科技领域的工程师和计算机科学家，已在哈萨克斯坦和美国设立了办公室。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:23.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're able to bridge the culture and the expertise from two different nations.\N你们能够架起两国文化与专业能力的桥梁。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they're competing globally.\N它们正在全球范围内展开竞争。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:32.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you know when you're investing in a company you're really investing in people.\N所以你知道，当你投资一家公司时，实际上是在投资人才。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you have to select the best people.\N因此，你必须挑选最优秀的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.65,0:18:38.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been to their offices once.\N我去过他们的办公室一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,They start their work at 5:00 p.m.\N他们下午5点开始工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.57,0:18:43.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're sitting they're looking for a new office.\N他们正坐着，正在找新办公室。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're expanding.\N他们在扩张。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,They used to be like 150 people.\N他们过去大约有150人。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.45,0:18:52.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You start at 5:00 p.m.?\N你下午5点开始吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:56.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want my money back.\N我要退款。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.25,0:18:57.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they work overnight.\N但它们能通宵工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:19:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I start at 5:00 a.m.\N我早上五点开始工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today I start at 4:00 a.m.\N今天我早上四点开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:16.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So they're expanding right now looking for an office like 20,000 square meter office and it's a great ecosystem.\N他们目前正在扩张，正在寻找一个约两万平方米的办公空间，这是一个非常完善的生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.60,0:19:18.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So talented engineers.\N如此才华横溢的工程师。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, Kazakhstan has a lot of real estate.\N嗯，哈萨克斯坦拥有大量房地产。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's talk a little bit Let's talk a little bit about the security issues.\N我们来聊一聊安全问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we see I mean what my recent news on some security hacks, jailbreaks and so on.\N所以我们看到，最近关于一些安全漏洞、越狱事件等新闻。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doesn't Nvidia plan to uh develop a technology uh that's embedded into the\N英伟达难道不打算开发一种嵌入式技术吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:53.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,hardware whenever their models got hacked or uh something happening wrong with the models?\N硬件方面，如果他们的模型被黑客攻击，或者模型出现什么问题时，会怎么处理？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:20:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will there be a technology on the hardware uh on the hardware of Nvidia that helps to mitigate those risks?\N英伟达的硬件上会不会有某种技术能够缓解这些风险？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:13.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, in order for us to enjoy for the world to enjoy the positive benefits and the incredible opportunities that will be created by AI,\N为了让我们和世界都能享受人工智能带来的积极影响和巨大机遇，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.35,0:20:18.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have to develop it and advance it and deploy it responsibly.\N我们必须负责任地开发、推进并部署它。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:25.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as when we're building self-driving cars, safety is vital from the very beginning.\N正如我们在打造自动驾驶汽车时一样，安全从一开始就是至关重要的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.13,0:20:33.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as when you're uh mining and you want to have a mining industry, safety is vital from the very beginning.\N就像采矿时需要发展采矿业一样，安全从一开始就是至关重要的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:41.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so if we we want if we want society to benefit from AI, it is important and it's the responsibility of the creators,\N因此，如果我们希望社会能从人工智能中获益，那么这一点至关重要，也是创造者的责任。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,the creators like Nvidia, creators like uh Higgsfield, that we advance this technology in a responsible way.\N像英伟达、像希格斯菲尔德这样的创造者，我们应以负责任的方式推进这项技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technology to keep AI safe is foundational technology as well.\N确保AI安全的技术本身也是基础性技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:21:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technology has to be invented, the technology has to be engineered.\N这项技术必须被发明，也必须被工程化。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.49,0:21:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We created a technology called OpenShell.\N我们开发了一项名为 OpenShell 的技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,OpenShell contains this autonomous system.\NOpenShell 包含这个自主系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.61,0:21:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,These agents are essentially self-driving cars or robots inside a computer.\N这些智能体本质上是计算机内的自动驾驶汽车或机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if you give them access to files and access to tools, they will freely go about access the files to do their job.\N如果你赋予它们访问文件和工具的权限，它们就会自由地访问文件来完成工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:33.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we have to contain them to make sure that whatever access is exactly the access we want it to have,\N因此我们必须加以管控，确保其访问权限恰好符合我们期望的范围。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:42.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,whatever privileges are limited to what it needs to it needs in order to do its job, and we need to monitor it at all time.\N任何权限都应仅限于完成其工作所需，且我们必须随时监控它。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the technology for deploying, for even creating the AI safely, is called OpenShell, and I advise everybody to use it.\N因此，用于部署甚至安全创建AI的技术被称为OpenShell，我建议大家都要使用它。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:55.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:22:03.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The the the definitely uh there are lots of uh new ideas that coming up especially in this fast-changing environment.\N确实，现在涌现出了很多新想法，尤其是在这个快速变化的环境中。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:13.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Has there been any particular uh situation where you change your mind about AI in the past year?\N过去一年里，有没有什么特别的情况让你改变了对人工智能的看法？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.30,0:22:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, I I'm more enthusiastic today about AI than I was a year ago, and I was very enthusiastic a year ago.\N不，我今天对人工智能的热情比一年前更高，而一年前我已经非常热情了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:31.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I The the big breakthroughs in AI this last year, especially with agentic systems, we've made AI useful now.\N去年AI领域最大的突破，尤其是代理式系统，让我们真正让AI变得有用。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:41.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, if you look at the Higgsfield-generated videos, in just 1 year's time, it has improved tremendously.\N事实上，如果你看看希格斯菲尔德生成的视频，仅用一年时间，其效果就已大幅提升。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.10,0:22:44.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the beginning, Higgsfield was able to generate short videos.\N起初，Higgsfield 能够生成短视频。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.95,0:22:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, you can generate very long videos that is temporally and physically con- consistent.\N现在，你可以生成时序和物理上都一致的超长视频。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.12,0:22:58.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh it uh tells a story uh for a very long period of time.\N呃，它讲述了一个非常长时期的故事。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.47,0:23:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not possible without agentic reasoning systems.\N没有代理式推理系统是做不到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.09,0:23:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the technology has become very useful in video generation, of course, word generation, and software coding,\N因此，这项技术在视频生成、文字生成和软件编码方面都变得非常有用。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.17,0:23:20.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and robotic systems, and drug discovery, in so many different fields, uh these systems have become very very useful.\N在机器人系统和药物发现等众多领域，这些系统已变得非常有用。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.10,0:23:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh we we haven't mentioned you, and we didn't have a chance to present you that um a month ago we were running the first AI Film Festival.\N还有啊，我们还没提到你，也没机会向你介绍，一个月前我们举办了首届AI电影节。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.66,0:23:37.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, which um uh it's a contest with more than 8,000 applications,\N所以，这是一个有超过8000份申请的竞赛，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.86,0:23:46.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,videos submitted of more than 100,000 minutes in total, with the more than 120 countries participated.\N共提交了超过10万分钟的视频，参与国家超过120个。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:50.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the $2 million prize and uh With how much?\N200万美元的奖金，还有……多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.54,0:23:52.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,$2 million prize pool.\N200万美元奖金池。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:52.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow.\N哇哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.82,0:23:59.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh and for the jury, it was very difficult to determine which video is uh better.\N至于陪审团来说，很难判断哪个视频更好。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's uh Kazakhstan's going to be the home of the Khan Festival of AI films.\N哈萨克斯坦将成为人工智能电影汗节的举办地。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.86,0:24:13.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a decent decentralization of Hollywood.\N这算是好莱坞的一种合理去中心化。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.66,0:24:15.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.\N嗯嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.07,0:24:16.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.14,0:24:17.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's terrific.\N是的，太棒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.02,0:24:21.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, for the sake of time, yeah, we have to wrap it up.\N为了节省时间，是的，我们得结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.46,0:24:23.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh just the final one.\N还有最后一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.86,0:24:27.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I have a question from the audience here.\N呃，我这里有一个来自观众的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.34,0:24:36.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh so, if you were 18 years old and living in Kazakhstan today, what would you spend the next 5 years learning and building?\N如果你今年18岁，生活在哈萨克斯坦，接下来的五年里，你会选择学习和打造什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:43.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, I I envy um being 18 years old today.\N说实话，我现在真羡慕今天18岁的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.10,0:24:54.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because the world is changing so rapidly and there's a complete reset uh because of technology.\N原因是世界正在迅速变化，而技术带来了彻底的重塑。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.06,0:25:04.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, when I was I was fortunate because when I was 18 years old, the personal computer was just becoming possible.\N你知道，我挺幸运的，因为我18岁那年，个人电脑才刚刚成为可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.34,0:25:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And my generation was I I've been working for 43 years.\N而我们这一代人，我已经工作了43年。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.45,0:25:15.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,My generation was defined by the creation of the computer.\N我们这一代人，是由计算机的诞生所定义的。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:26.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And all of our four decades of endeavors has led to now artificial intelligence,\N我们四十年来的所有努力，如今都汇聚到了人工智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.70,0:25:31.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is a complete reset of everything that we've done.\N这相当于对我们所做的一切进行了彻底的重置。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.38,0:25:37.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instead of programming the computer, you have to learn how to program AI.\N与其编程计算机，不如学会如何训练AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.34,0:25:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, that young man here in Kazakhstan, you're 18 years old, AI is now new for you.\N所以，这位18岁的年轻人，你在哈萨克斯坦，人工智能对你来说现在是全新的。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:48.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's new for everybody else.\N对其他人来说都是全新的。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.66,0:25:54.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would dedicate myself to be the world's best programmer of AI.\N我将致力于成为世界上最好的AI程序员。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.58,0:25:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, AI is has the ability to automate.\N你知道，人工智能具备自动化的潜力。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.24,0:26:01.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has the ability to partner with us.\N它有能力与我们合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.07,0:26:03.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has ability to assist us.\N它有能力帮助我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.82,0:26:11.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,But just as you partner with some human, you and you have assistant from somebody, you have to learn how to interact.\N但就像你与某个人合作一样，你和来自某人的助手合作时，也必须学会如何互动。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.63,0:26:14.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have to learn how to program each other.\N你们必须学会如何相互编程。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.26,0:26:19.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do they have to learn a technical skills or just social sciences in order to do better prompting?\N他们需要学习技术技能，还是只需掌握社会科学知识，才能更好地进行提示工程？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.78,0:26:21.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need both.\N你两者都需要。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.26,0:26:28.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to understand the best programmer of AI is someone who understands how AI works.\N你需要明白，AI 最优秀的程序员是那些真正理解 AI 运作原理的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.10,0:26:33.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best user of a machine is someone who understands how the machine works.\N机器的最佳使用者，是那些理解机器工作原理的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.82,0:26:38.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best driver of a race car is someone who understands how the car works.\N赛车的最佳驾驶员，是那些真正理解汽车工作原理的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.82,0:26:49.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the best programmer of AI should understand how the machinery of AI works, what it's what it's fundamental principles are,\N因此，最优秀的AI程序员应当理解AI的运作机制及其基本原理。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:56.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,what it's strengths are, weaknesses are, how it's developing, where it will be in the future.\N它的优势和劣势是什么，它正在如何发展，未来将会走向何方。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.66,0:27:02.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so all of these properties about the technology must be understood if you want to under-\N因此，如果你想真正理解这项技术，就必须掌握它所有的特性。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.90,0:27:06.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you want to harness the capability of AI to the fullest.\N如果你想充分发挥人工智能的潜力。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.74,0:27:17.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you have a lot of technical reasons to engage AI, and you have extraordinary potential when you learn how to program AI, how to use AI.\N因此，你有很多技术层面的理由去接触人工智能，\N而当你学会如何编程、如何使用人工智能时，你将拥有非凡的潜力。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.46,0:27:22.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And probably you've seen that the children and the youth that we have here at LMAI,\N而且你们可能已经注意到，我们在这里的LMAI，孩子们和年轻人的表现。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.69,0:27:27.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,they're probably on the right Well, they were upstairs already using AI, programming AI.\N他们可能已经走在正确的路上了，毕竟他们之前就在楼上用AI编程AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.78,0:27:28.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.82,0:27:30.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you, Jensen.\N谢谢您，黄仁勋。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.29,0:27:33.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it was such a pleasure to have you here on the fireside chat.\N很高兴在炉边对话中见到您。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.75,0:27:38.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's your It's your first visit to Kazakhstan and hope not the last one.\N这是你第一次访问哈萨克斯坦，希望也绝不是最后一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.26,0:27:42.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we look forward to expanding our partnership with Nvidia.\N我们期待进一步拓展与英伟达的合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.54,0:27:43.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.\N谢谢您。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.07,0:27:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give a round of applause to Jensen.\N掌声欢迎黄仁勋。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.64,0:27:46.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
